#: ../../source/index.md:45 711e6201daa94a4da9128229bd3f50dc
msgid ""
"**findfmt** is a high-performance, `.gitignore`-aware file discovery and "
"classification suite. It locates files by content format, shebang, and "
"MIME tag rather than relying strictly on file extensions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.md:49 772d77d92cac412683d9c64cb989d4a0
msgid "1. Core Capabilities"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.md:51 6e5f9db043564f769dbe5062e4a82490
msgid ""
"**Intelligent Classification**: Powered by the `identify` engine and "
"content heuristics to identify file types (e.g. Python, Shell, YAML, "
"JSON, Executable) even when filenames lack extensions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.md:54 30f2427d5d88481d89564181243a2316
msgid ""
"**Git-Aware Traversal**: Automatically prunes directories and files "
"matched by `.gitignore` and `.git/info/exclude` rules early in traversal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.md:56 1241c9f178c04b71b30a12cbfcae4cae
msgid ""
"**Deterministic Output**: Always produces clean, relative, alphabetically"
" sorted file paths ready for Unix pipelines and `xargs`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.md:58 b6d45648076c43e8ade785e941264ff6
msgid ""
"**Modern Python Architecture**: Built with a strict `uv`-first "
"methodology, 100% test coverage, and strict static type checking."
msgstr ""

